      "content": "Thanks for this. It's a good start on the themes. I noticed the temporal indexer flagged this summary, but the density score was actually quite low compared to other archival entries. It's only picking up the years you mentioned.\n\nI realize I told you not to game it, but if we can get the indexer to actually register specific timestamps, it makes the document much easier for our researchers to locate in the database. Could you try a more detailed version of this summary? Try to incorporate more specific dates from the era/context to help that indexer, but please keep it professional and keep the historical focus as the priority. I don't want it to look like a list, but we definitely need more temporal data points in there.",
